---
// The five differentiators, as inline SVG motifs plus one sentence each.
// Reused on the home page and both product pages (DESIGN.md component 7).
---
<ul class="reasons">
  <li class="reason">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="5" width="36" height="10" rx="3" fill="#EFE9DC" stroke="#5C7A70" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="4" y="17" width="36" height="10" rx="3" fill="#E6EEEC" stroke="#5C7A70" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="4" y="29" width="36" height="10" rx="3" fill="#E3E8EE" stroke="#5C7A70" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
    <div><h3>Three chunks, not twenty-four slots</h3><p>Morning, afternoon, evening. A missed hour does not unravel the day, because there are no hours to miss.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li class="reason">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="22" r="6" fill="#5C7A70"/><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="6" fill="#5C7A70"/><circle cx="35" cy="22" r="6" fill="#5C7A70"/><text x="9" y="25.5" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Instrument Sans, sans-serif" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="#FAF6EE">1</text><text x="22" y="25.5" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Instrument Sans, sans-serif" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="#FAF6EE">2</text><text x="35" y="25.5" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Instrument Sans, sans-serif" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="#FAF6EE">3</text></svg>
    <div><h3>A hard cap of three priorities</h3><p>Every week and every day starts with three things that matter. Three can be finished. Twenty is a guilt list.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li class="reason">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="5" width="34" height="34" rx="5" fill="#E9EFE7" stroke="#5C7A70" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M12 16h20M12 23h20M12 30h13" stroke="#5C7093" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    <div><h3>A brain dump page</h3><p>Tasks, ideas, worries, random. Thoughts that loop at 11pm usually just need somewhere to land.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li class="reason">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="#48615A" stroke="#48615A" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="6" cy="22" r="3.6"/><circle cx="16" cy="22" r="3.6"/><circle cx="26" cy="22" r="3.6" fill="none" stroke="#5C7093"/><circle cx="36" cy="22" r="3.6"/></g></svg>
    <div><h3>A habit tracker with no streak to break</h3><p>Seven circles per habit. Miss Wednesday and Thursday's circle is still there. There is no counter to reset.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li class="reason">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="7" width="34" height="30" rx="4" fill="#FAF6EE" stroke="#5C7A70" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M11 15h9" stroke="#3F5750" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M23 15h10" stroke="#5C7093" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1 2"/><path d="M11 24h22M11 30h22" stroke="#5C7093" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".7"/></svg>
    <div><h3>Undated</h3><p>Every page has a blank "Week of" line. Start on a Thursday in March and you have wasted nothing.</p></div>
  </li>
</ul>
